{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"a5b9095562d91d1a23014bb681dddf7f9f75df2a35e796434312ea1c8fe0c2cd","digest":{"component_or_area":"plan-review manifest tests","key_entities":["src/rebar/llm/plan_review/manifest.py:497","src/rebar/_signing_manifest.py:_gate_commit_sha","rebar.signing.gate_code_version","tests/unit/test_plan_review.py:965-966","tests/unit/test_plan_review.py::test_manifest_file_scope_contract_preserves_legacy_bytes","tests/unit/test_plan_material_pins.py:79","tests/unit/test_plan_material_pins.py::test_no_pins_preserves_legacy_manifest_bytes","tests/unit/test_gate_engine_cutover.py::test_manifest_is_deterministic_and_path_independent"],"problem_keywords":["test flakiness","manifest byte-equality","git dirty-state","pytest-xdist","race condition","nondeterministic test"],"propositions":["Manifest byte-equality tests flake under pytest-xdist because gate_code_version() shells git status --porcelain per call, and concurrent workers can modify the checkout between two build_manifest calls within one test, flipping the -dirty suffix.","Two manifest byte-equality tests compare separately-built manifests without pinning the git version string: test_manifest_file_scope_contract_preserves_legacy_bytes and test_manifest_is_deterministic_and_path_independent.","Monkeypatching rebar.signing.gate_code_version to a constant in byte-equality tests prevents the dirty-state from flipping between build_manifest calls and eliminates the flake.","test_no_pins_preserves_legacy_manifest_bytes already demonstrates the correct pattern by pinning gate_code_version during its manifest equality check."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787494369638270001,"uuid":"8dca38b9-3435-4d75-a4ff-55f5e59975ad"}